{
  "name": "SELinux Remediation Workflow",
  "description": "EDA -> AI analysis -> Report -> ServiceNow change ticket -> Approval poll -> AAP remediation -> Observation. AO 2026.8 expressions: trigger output is the webhook body (${trigger.payload.*}); agentic output is ${n1.result.content}; AAP artifacts are ${n3a.artifacts.*}. API: /docs",
  "workflow_definition": {
    "schema_version": "2.0.0",
    "name": "SELinux Remediation Workflow",
    "description": "EDA -> AI analysis -> Report -> ServiceNow change ticket -> Approval poll -> AAP remediation -> Observation",
    "triggers": [
      {
        "id": "t1",
        "type": "eda_trigger",
        "name": "SELinux EDA Trigger",
        "parameters": {
          "webhook_path": "selinux",
          "authorized_service_account_ids": ["PLACEHOLDER_SA_ID"]
        }
      }
    ],
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "n1",
        "type": "agentic",
        "name": "AI Analysis",
        "parameters": {
          "prompt": "Analyze SELinux AVC denials from RHEL 10.2 (httpd, /srv/webapp/, permissive mode).\n\nAVC Denials:\n${trigger.payload.avc_denials}\n\naudit2allow:\n${trigger.payload.audit2allow_output}\n\nGroup duplicate denials. Prefer semanage fcontext over booleans/modules.\n\nReturn ONLY raw JSON. Do NOT wrap in markdown code fences. Do NOT use ```json or ```.\nStart your response with { and end with }.\nFormat: {\"summary\":\"brief\",\"findings\":[{\"denial\":\"short desc\",\"source_type\":\"\",\"target_type\":\"\",\"target_path\":\"\",\"permission\":\"\",\"recommendation\":\"short fix\",\"remediation\":{\"type\":\"fcontext|boolean|port|module\",\"selinux_type\":\"\",\"path_spec\":\"\",\"boolean_name\":\"\",\"boolean_value\":\"\"}}],\"audit2allow_assessment\":\"brief\"}",
          "llm_model_id": "PLACEHOLDER_LLM_MODEL_ID",
          "credential_id": "PLACEHOLDER_LLM_CRED_ID",
          "tool_selection_strategy": "NONE",
          "responseSchema": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": ["summary", "findings", "audit2allow_assessment"],
            "properties": {
              "summary": { "type": "string" },
              "audit2allow_assessment": { "type": "string" },
              "findings": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "required": ["denial", "recommendation", "remediation"],
                  "properties": {
                    "denial": { "type": "string" },
                    "source_type": { "type": "string" },
                    "target_type": { "type": "string" },
                    "target_path": { "type": "string" },
                    "permission": { "type": "string" },
                    "recommendation": { "type": "string" },
                    "remediation": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "additionalProperties": false,
                      "required": ["type"],
                      "properties": {
                        "type": { "type": "string" },
                        "selinux_type": { "type": "string" },
                        "path_spec": { "type": "string" },
                        "boolean_name": { "type": "string" },
                        "boolean_value": { "type": "string" }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "n2",
        "type": "aap_job_template",
        "name": "Generate Report",
        "parameters": {
          "job_template_id": 0,
          "integration_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_INT_ID",
          "credential_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_CRED_ID",
          "extra_vars": {
            "trigger_payload": "${trigger.payload}",
            "selinux_analysis_json": "${n1.result.content}"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "n3a",
        "type": "aap_job_template",
        "name": "Create ServiceNow Change",
        "parameters": {
          "job_template_id": 0,
          "integration_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_INT_ID",
          "credential_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_CRED_ID",
          "extra_vars": {
            "selinux_analysis_json": "${n1.result.content}",
            "vm_name": "${trigger.payload.host}"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "n3b",
        "type": "aap_job_template",
        "name": "Check ServiceNow Approval",
        "parameters": {
          "job_template_id": 0,
          "integration_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_INT_ID",
          "credential_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_CRED_ID",
          "extra_vars": {
            "servicenow_change_sys_id": "${n3a.artifacts.servicenow_change_sys_id}"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "n4",
        "type": "aap_job_template",
        "name": "Apply Remediation",
        "parameters": {
          "job_template_id": 0,
          "integration_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_INT_ID",
          "credential_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_CRED_ID",
          "extra_vars": {
            "trigger_payload": "${trigger.payload}",
            "selinux_analysis_json": "${n1.result.content}"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "n5",
        "type": "aap_job_template",
        "name": "Post-Remediation Observation",
        "parameters": {
          "job_template_id": 0,
          "integration_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_INT_ID",
          "credential_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_CRED_ID",
          "extra_vars": {
            "vm_name": "${trigger.payload.host}",
            "pre_avc_count": "${trigger.payload.avc_count}"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "edges": [
      { "from": "t1", "to": "n1" },
      { "from": "n1", "to": "n2" },
      { "from": "n2", "to": "n3a" },
      { "from": "n3a", "to": "n3b" },
      { "from": "n4", "to": "n5" },
      { "from": "n3b", "to": "n4" }
    ]
  }
}
